<title>USA: Option Care tapped by ChoiceCare.</title>
<headline>Option Care tapped by ChoiceCare.</headline>
<dateline>BANNOCKBURN, Ill. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Option Care Inc said Thursday it was picked as one of the providers for home health services by Cincinnati-based ChoiceCare, a health maintenance organization.</p>
<p>This selection adds home health services to ChoiceCare's existing relationship with Option Care as a provider of home infusion services.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
